{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56715","headline":"凤凰峰 · 无名氏","name":"凤凰峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文凤集南岳，徘徊竹孤根。\n於心有不厌，奋翅凌紫云。\n岂不曾辛苦，羞与黄雀羣。\n何时尝来仪，顺於圣明君。\n（以上四首均见宋陈田夫《南岳总胜集》卷上。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}